        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana ZA2024, ZA Series 24 Inch Towel Shelf With Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis hotel towel shelf is built to last with the quality that Deltana is known for. An affordable and modern storage option, this wall mounted shelf is perfect for keeping extra towels within reach of the tub and at 24\" in length, it is large enough to hold even the most plush towels. It is available in two modern finishes--polished chrome and satin nickel--for a clean, contemporary look. The modern square shape brings interesting design to the lowly towel shelf.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2024-specifications.gif?v=1704354669\" width=\"600\" height=\"416\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana ZA2024 24\" Towel Shelf With Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana ZA Series\"><b>Deltana ZA Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern Value Solid Brass 24 Inch Towel Shelf With Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: zinc and aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 23-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Length: 1-1/8\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance From Shelf to Bar: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Towel Bar Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2024.pdf?v=1704262295\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana ZA2024 24\" Towel Shelf With Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 shelf bracket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
